# Purpose: when you need to UNINSTALL every ZAgentic skill from an agent's
# skills directory (e.g. ~/.workbuddy/skills, ~/.claude/skills, ~/.codex/skills),
# reference THIS file. Each non-comment, non-blank line is a skill directory
# name. Delete every listed directory in one prompt — no need to hunt them
# down one by one.
